hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"19236","Muhammad ibn Jafar narrated to us, Shubah narrated to us, he said: I heard Qatadah narrating from Zurarah ibn Awfa from Ubayy ibn Malik from the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) that he said: Whoever reaches his parents or one of them, then enters the Fire after that, Allah has cast him far and crushed him."
"19237","Hajjaj narrated to us, Shubah narrated to me from Qatadah, he said: I heard Zurarah ibn Awfa narrating from Ubayy ibn Malik from the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him)."
"19238","Bahz narrated to me, he said: Shubah narrated to us from Qatadah from Zurarah ibn Awfa from a man of his people called Ubayy ibn Malik that he heard the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) say: Whoever reaches his parents or one of them and enters the Fire, Allah has cast him far."
